---
title: "invest (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_cancelled: investor invokes invest(maxAmount, signature)
    q_check_cancelled --> q_revert_cancel: sale is cancelled
    q_revert_cancel --> [*]: revert SaleCancelled
    q_check_cancelled --> q_check_ended: sale is active
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_ended: sale has ended
    q_revert_ended --> [*]: revert SaleEnded
    q_check_ended --> q_validate_sig: sale not ended
    q_validate_sig --> q_revert_sig: signature verification fails
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_validate_sig --> q_check_min: signature valid
    q_check_min --> q_revert_min: maxAmount < minimumInvestAmount
    q_revert_min --> [*]: revert BelowMinimumInvestment
    q_check_min --> q_transfer: maxAmount >= minimumInvestAmount
    q_transfer --> q_update: transferFrom(investor, address(this), maxAmount)
    q_update --> [*]: position.totalInvested += maxAmount; totalCapitalInvested += maxAmount; emit Invested(investor, maxAmount)

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: maxAmount represents maximum allocation commitment, not guaranteed allocation
        INV-002: Actual allocation determined by project during application processing
        INV-003: Excess capital refundable after results publication via Merkle proof
    end note
